# Platform: mobilesite
# Story: GJDT-22417 — the icon is the same size and sits at the top-right on both the Photos grid and the gallery view (AC6)
# Tags: b2b, pdp, 360, GJDT-22417
open ${prot3_pdp_360_photos}
wait for page to load
wait 4 seconds
store position of pdp_photo_360_icon in pdp_photo_tile_image as grid_icon_position
click pdp_first_photo
wait 3 seconds
verify element gallery_360_icon is inside gallery_slide_image
store position of gallery_360_icon in gallery_slide_image as gallery_icon_position
verify element gallery_360_icon is the same size as pdp_photo_360_icon
take screenshot as both_surfaces_gallery
